,"nextNodeIds":[761190104]},{"nodeId":761190104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1447365234,"text":"They seem to be having fun.","nextNodeIds":[761190105]},{"nodeId":761190105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1799947986,"text":"Greetings.","nextNodeIds":[761190106]},{"nodeId":761190106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15380,"speakerName":"Luonnotar","textMapHash":1506869986,"text":"!!!","nextNodeIds":[761190107]},{"nodeId":761190107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2949464106,"text":"Greetings to you too, Luonnotar.","nextNodeIds":[761190108]},{"nodeId":761190108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1038425162,"text":"Playing a new game?","nextNodeIds":[761190109]},{"nodeId":761190109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":4285216658,"text":"Yes. I saw people playing with their friends using cups at The Flagship, so I borrowed the idea.","nextNodeIds":[761190110]},{"nodeId":761190110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3545235706,"text":"They would place a gemstone under a cup, then quickly shuffle the cups atop the table.","nextNodeIds":[761190111]},{"nodeId":761190111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2266635266,"text":"Upon stopping, they would have the other player guess which cup the gem was under.","nextNodeIds":[761190112]},{"nodeId":761190112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":311132834,"text":"The kuuhenki love the feeling of spinning about while wrapped up in cloth, so I used Miss Mage's hat as a reference and made some improvements.","nextNodeIds":[761190113]},{"nodeId":761190113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1752968746,"text":"It's adorable.","nextNodeIds":[761190114]},{"nodeId":761190114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7190,"speakerName":"Kuuhenki","textMapHash":2623919522,"text":"~!","nextNodeIds":[761190115]},{"nodeId":761190115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1103758498,"text":"Wait. So you went to The Flagship... did anyone recognize you?","nextNodeIds":[761190116]},{"nodeId":761190116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2133334698,"text":"Some did ask, and I said, \"I'm dressing up as the Moon Goddess today. I look just like her, don't I?\"","nextNodeIds":[761190117]},{"nodeId":761190117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":380785778,"text":"Wow, you've really taken that trick from Moon-Prayer Night and ran with it...","nextNodeIds":[761190118]},{"nodeId":761190118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3661989818,"text":"And they believed you?","nextNodeIds":[761190119]},{"nodeId":761190119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2816898634,"text":"Well... Not entirely, but they didn't talk to me afterward either.","nextNodeIds":[761190120]},{"nodeId":761190120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3924720690,"text":"Was my acting not natural? I'll keep practicing somewhere else next time.","nextNodeIds":[761190121]},{"nodeId":761190121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2415214346,"text":"Why does it feel like someone learned all the wrong lessons...","nextNodeIds":[761190122]},{"nodeId":761190122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15380,"speakerName":"Luonnotar","textMapHash":2611176914,"text":"!!!","nextNodeIds":[761190123]},{"nodeId":761190123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3375378938,"text":"Luonnotar would like you to guess where she's hiding. Would you like to play a round?","nextNodeIds":[761190124]},{"nodeId":761190124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3516225154,"text":"I'm in!","nextNodeIds":[761190125]},{"nodeId":761190125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3600470130,"text":"In that case, please stake 100,000 Mora to start with. Those are The Flagship's rules, after all.","nextNodeIds":[761190126]},{"nodeId":761190126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1405219994,"text":"Okay, you definitely should've skipped that lesson!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7611901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1318"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7611905,"order":3,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":429574060,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"761190201"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GU